<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Access Denied (403) - Learning Dashboard</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; color: white;">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 500px; padding: 2rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);">
        <div style="font-size: 6rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">403</div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Access Denied</h2>
        <p style="opacity: 0.9; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem;">You do not have the required permissions to view this resource. Please make sure you are logged in with the correct credentials.</p>
        <div>
            <a href="index.jsp" class="btn btn-secondary" style="background-color: white; color: var(--primary-color); border: none; font-weight: 600; margin-right: 0; padding: 0.8rem 2rem;">Back to Safety</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
